    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34939" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναπο-νίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wash clean in</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Polyzel.
					4
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐναπονίζεσθαι τοὺς πόδας ἐν
				τῷ ποδανιπτῆρι</span>
			<i>wash one's</i> feet in it, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.172
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					1.138
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>wash off from oneself in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ποταμῷ τὸ αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Paus.
					9.30.8
				</span></i>
			.</div>
